    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# WEATHER REPORTER\n\nA Telegram-based weather assistant that accepts a user's natural-language request and identifies the city they want weather information for.\n\nThe workflow uses an LLM to extract and validate the city name, retrieves real-time weather data from OpenWeatherMap, and formats the raw API response into structured weather information.\n\nA second LLM transforms the weather data into a concise, polite, and easy-to-understand weather report containing only information provided by the weather API.\n\nThe final weather report is automatically sent back to the user through Telegram, while invalid requests are handled by asking the user to provide a valid city name.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 784
